:name: Trainer lane, live
:description: lane.resc plus a bridge from the emulated CAN bus to the host's SocketCAN vcan0, and UART logs in files, for the lane console demo.

# Required: $elf. Host prerequisite (Linux/WSL): modprobe vcan; ip link add dev vcan0 type vcan; ip link set up vcan0

include $ORIGIN/lane.resc

machine CreateSocketCANBridge "socketcan" "vcan0"
connector Connect socketcan canHub

mach set "weapon1"
sysbus.usart2 CreateFileBackend @/tmp/trainer_weapon1_uart.log true
mach set "weapon2"
sysbus.usart2 CreateFileBackend @/tmp/trainer_weapon2_uart.log true
